  THE THREE SHAPES, which is what makes them separable without trusting the stellar M/L:
     framework, isolated deep MOND : sigma_los INDEPENDENT of separation, sigma ~ M_b^{1/4}
     framework, external-field branch and Newton and cosmic share : sigma ~ r^{-1/2}, sigma ~ M_b^{1/2}
     LambdaCDM abundance-matched   : nearly flat in r over 100-1000 kpc (the NFW halo grows with r), M_b^{~0.9}

